---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/tools/"
title: "Tools"
description: "Free tools by Max Murphy — operational diagnostics, GEO and SEO readiness, product scoping, and forecast calibration. All run in your browser."
hasFilter: true
---
{%- set categories = [] -%}
{%- for t in tools -%}
  {%- if t.category not in categories -%}{%- set categories = (categories.push(t.category), categories) -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- set liveCount = (tools | selectattr("status", "equalto", "live") | list | length) -%}

<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">Tools</p>
  <h1 class="display">Things that do the work, not describe it.</h1>
  <p class="prose measure" style="font-size:1.15rem">A growing suite of diagnostics and calculators across operations, SEO, marketing, AI, and product. Every one runs entirely in your browser &mdash; no accounts, no email gates, and nothing you enter leaves your machine.</p>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight wrap" style="padding-top:0">

  <div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter tools by category">
    <button class="filter-chip" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {%- for cat in categories %}
    <button class="filter-chip" type="button" data-filter="{{ cat }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ cat }}</button>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="filter-count" data-filter-count aria-live="polite">{{ tools | length }} tools</p>

  <div class="product-grid" data-filter-scope>
    {%- for t in tools %}
    <article class="product-card" data-category="{{ t.category }}">
      <div>
        <div class="product-card__meta">
          <span>{{ t.category }}</span>
          <span>{{ "Live" if t.status == "live" else "In development" }}</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="product-card__name">
          {% if t.status == "live" %}<a href="/tools/{{ t.slug }}/" style="text-decoration:none">{{ t.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ t.name }}{% endif %}
        </h2>

        <p class="prose" style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:.75rem">{{ t.tagline }}</p>
        <p class="product-card__summary">{{ t.summary }}</p>

        {% if t.status == "live" %}
        <p style="margin-top:.9rem"><a class="arrow-link" href="/tools/{{ t.slug }}/">Open {{ t.name }}</a></p>
        {% else %}
        <p style="margin-top:.9rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-faint)">Not built yet. <a href="/contact/">Tell me if you&rsquo;d use it</a> and it moves up the list.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="product-card__metrics">
        <div>
          <div class="product-metric__label">Output</div>
          <div style="font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-muted)">{{ t.output }}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="product-metric__label">Time</div>
          <div style="font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-muted)">{{ t.time }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="viz__note" style="margin-top:2rem">
    {{ liveCount }} of {{ tools | length }} are built. The rest are scoped rather than
    promised &mdash; I&rsquo;d rather ship two that work properly than seven that rot.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="headline">What would you actually use?</h2>
    <p class="prose measure" style="margin-inline:auto">These come from problems I keep running into. If you have one worth building, tell me.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/contact/" style="background:#fff;color:var(--blue)">Suggest a tool</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
